{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-particle-nf-table-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:particle-nf-table-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table from rem:particle-nf-table","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-particle-nf-table"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"particle-nf-table-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:particle-nf-table-table-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table from rem:particle-nf-table</em></p>\n<p>Each row records the Gröbner normal form of a particle's Hecke word\nin <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_3(q)</code> at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = q_0</code>, expanded over the six basis channels\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma,\\ \\sigma_0,\\ \\sigma_1,\\ L_+,\\ L_-,\\ e^-</code>: a numeric entry is\nthat basis element's coefficient in the normal form (a dash marks a\nzero coefficient), and the <strong>net</strong> column is their sum. The full\ndiscussion is in\n<a href=\"#rem:particle-nf-table\">Fundamental particle NF decomposition</a>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Particle</th>\n<th>Knot</th>\n<th>Hecke word</th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L_+</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L_-</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^-</code></th>\n<th align=\"right\">net</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nu</code></td>\n<td>unknot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0_1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\gamma</code></td>\n<td>point <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varnothing</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0</code></td>\n<td>virtual</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code></td>\n<td>virtual</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L_+</code> (gluon)</td>\n<td>Hopf <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(2,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0\\sigma_1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L_-</code> (gluon)</td>\n<td>Hopf <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(2,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1\\sigma_0</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^-</code></td>\n<td>trefoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0\\sigma_1\\sigma_0</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\">—</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1.000</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^+</code></td>\n<td>mirror <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0^{-1}\\sigma_1^{-1}\\sigma_0^{-1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.218</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+0.044</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+0.044</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code cla